Source Code
* https://github.com/Larsen-Locke/openhab-gardena-local-binding

The GARDENA smart local API (the WebSocket service on the GARDENA smart Gateway, its message format and the
device data paths) is documented by GARDENA's own open-source client library and Home Assistant integration:

    https://github.com/cloudless-garden/gardena-smart-local-api        (LGPL-3.0-or-later, (c) 2026 GARDENA GmbH)
    https://github.com/cloudless-garden/ha-gardena-smart-local-preview (Apache-2.0, (c) 2026 GARDENA GmbH)

This binding contains no code from either project. It is an independent Java implementation of the same
protocol, written against those projects as a reference for message shapes, resource paths and device
behaviour. The test fixture src/test/resources/device-list.json is modelled on the structure of the
library's test data, with values of its own.
